**** GT Loads column represents load cell count of GT types


+----+----+----+
|    | X0 | X1 |
+----+----+----+
| Y2 |  0 |  0 |
| Y1 |  0 |  0 |
| Y0 |  0 |  1 |
+----+----+----+


